<template>
<main class="meeting" id="meeting">
    <!-- 顶栏展示会议状态与持续时间 -->
    <header class="topbar"><div class="meeting-mark">智</div><div><div class="meeting-title" id="meetingTitle">AI 产品经理 · 视频一面</div><div class="meeting-meta">会议号：825 317 604</div></div><div class="meeting-status"><span class="status-dot"></span><span>通话已加密</span></div><span class="timer" id="timer">00:00</span><span class="security">企业认证会议</span></header>
    <section class="stage"><div class="privacy-note">隐私提示：音视频仅在本机预览，本页面不会录制或上传</div><div class="share-banner" id="shareBanner">你正在共享屏幕</div><div class="remote-tile"><div class="remote-pattern"></div><div class="remote-person"><div class="remote-avatar" id="remoteAvatar">王</div><h1 id="remoteName">王雨晴</h1><p id="remoteCompany">极氪智能科技有限公司 · 招聘 HR</p></div><div class="speaking"><span class="levels"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>正在发言</div></div><div class="local-tile"><video id="localVideo" autoplay playsinline muted></video><div class="local-off" id="localOff"><div><div class="local-avatar">林</div><span>摄像头未开启</span></div></div><span class="tile-label">林晓雨（我）</span></div></section>
    <aside class="side-panel"><div class="panel-head"><strong>会议协作</strong><button class="close-panel" id="closePanel" aria-label="关闭侧栏">×</button></div><div class="panel-tabs"><button class="panel-tab active" data-panel="participants">参会人（3）</button><button class="panel-tab" data-panel="chat">聊天</button></div><div class="panel-view participant-view" id="participantView"><div class="participant"><span class="participant-avatar" id="participantAvatar">王</span><div class="participant-copy"><strong id="participantName">王雨晴（主持人）</strong><span id="participantCompany">招聘 HR · 极氪智能科技有限公司</span></div><span class="participant-state">●</span></div><div class="participant"><span class="participant-avatar">AI</span><div class="participant-copy"><strong>AI 面试官</strong><span>面试记录与辅助提问</span></div><span class="participant-state">●</span></div><div class="participant"><span class="participant-avatar">林</span><div class="participant-copy"><strong>林晓雨（我）</strong><span id="myMediaState">摄像头和麦克风已关闭</span></div><span>⌁</span></div></div><div class="chat-view" id="chatView"><div class="chat-list" id="chatList"><div class="chat-message"><b id="chatSender">王雨晴 <span class="chat-time">刚刚</span></b><p>你好，面试马上开始。准备好后可以打开摄像头和麦克风。</p></div></div><form class="chat-compose" id="chatForm"><input id="chatInput" placeholder="发送会议消息" aria-label="会议消息" /><button>发送</button></form></div></aside>
